  "title": "The Later Pandyas",
  "description": "An illustrated map of the Later Pandyas of Madurai, who overthrew the Cholas, roofed Srirangam with gold, ruled the pearl coast Marco Polo described, and split in a war of brothers that opened the south to Malik Kafur in 1311.",
