  "routes": "journey",
  "mapLabel": "The Later Pandyas, about 1216 to 1345 CE, and after",
  "note": "Based on Pandya inscriptions, the Sri Lankan Culavamsa, Marco Polo, the Persian histories of Wassaf and Amir Khusrau, and Ibn Battuta. Pandya kings often reigned jointly, so reign dates overlap and are debated. The map is stylised and not to scale.",
